{"page":227,"verses":[{"verse_key":"11:46","surah":11,"ayah":46,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ يَـٰنُوحُ إِنَّهُۥ لَيْسَ مِنْ أَهْلِكَ ۖ إِنَّهُۥ عَمَلٌ غَيْرُ صَـٰلِحٍ ۖ فَلَا تَسْـَٔلْنِ مَا لَيْسَ لَكَ بِهِۦ عِلْمٌ ۖ إِنِّىٓ أَعِظُكَ أَن تَكُونَ مِنَ ٱلْجَـٰهِلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God said, ‘Noah, he was not one of your family. What he did was not right. Do not ask Me for things you know nothing about. I am warning you not to be foolish.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"11:46"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَـٰنُوحُ","en_gloss":"O Nuh","transliteration":"yānūḥu","verse_key":"11:46"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, he","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"11:46"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَيْسَ","en_gloss":"(is) not","transliteration":"laysa","verse_key":"11:46"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"11:46"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَهْلِكَ ۖ","en_gloss":"your family","transliteration":"ahlika","verse_key":"11:46"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"indeed, [he]","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"11:46"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَمَلٌ","en_gloss":"(his) deed","transliteration":"ʿamalun","verse_key":"11:46"},{"pos":9,"ar":"غَيْرُ","en_gloss":"(is) other than","transliteration":"ghayru","verse_key":"11:46"},{"pos":10,"ar":"صَـٰلِحٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"righteous","transliteration":"ṣāliḥin","verse_key":"11:46"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"so (do) not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"11:46"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَسْـَٔلْنِ","en_gloss":"ask Me","transliteration":"tasalni","verse_key":"11:46"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(about) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"11:46"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَيْسَ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"laysa","verse_key":"11:46"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَكَ","en_gloss":"you have","transliteration":"laka","verse_key":"11:46"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"of it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"11:46"},{"pos":17,"ar":"عِلْمٌ ۖ","en_gloss":"any k